  <lyrics>
    <verse name="v1">
      <lines>
      <chord name="Bb"/>Don&#x27;t forget the Sabbath, The <chord name="F"/>Lord our God hath <chord name="Eb"/>ble<chord name="Bb"/>st,<br/>
      <chord name="Bb"/>Of all the week the brightest, Of <chord name="F"/>all the <chord name="C"/>week the <chord name="F"/>best;<br/>
      <chord name="F"/>It brings repose from <chord name="Bb"/>labor, It <chord name="F"/>tells of joy di<chord name="Bb"/>vine,<br/>
      <chord name="Bb"/>Its beams of <chord name="F7"/>light de<chord name="Gm"/>scend<chord name="Eb"/>ing, With <chord name="Bb"/>heav&#x27;nly <chord name="F"/>beauty <chord name="Bb"/>shine.<br/>
      <chord name="Bb"/>Welcome, <chord name="Eb7"/>welcome, <chord name="Gm"/>ever <chord name="Eb"/>welcome, <chord name="Bb"/>Blessèd<chord name="F"/> Sabbath<chord name="Eb"/> da<chord name="Bb"/>y.<br/>
      <chord name="Bb"/>Welcome, <chord name="Eb7"/>welcome, <chord name="Gm"/>ever <chord name="Eb"/>welcome, <chord name="Bb"/>Blessèd<chord name="F7"/> Sabbath<chord name="Bb"/> day.
      </lines>
